<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.T3.fig1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S5.T3.fig1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="S5.T3.fig1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation Study on the Maze Benchmark.</span>
Removing the auxiliary semantic loss or using explicit tokens both lead to significant performance degradation compared to our default choice.
</span></figcaption>
