            <math id="alg3.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P\leftarrow\text{Dijkstra}(\mathcal{G},s,g)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Dijkstra</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P\leftarrow\text{Dijkstra}(\mathcal{G},s,g)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l6.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Compute shortest path
